  "content": "\n\n<p>Elytra Slot 是一款利用 Curios API/Trinkets API 为玩家背包添加鞘翅槽位，并允许将鞘翅放入该槽位的模组。当鞘翅位于此槽位时，它将提供与放在胸甲槽位相同的飞行能力。这使得玩家能够在不占用护甲槽位的情况下享受鞘翅带来的便利。</p>\n<h3>Forge 依赖项</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caelus</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Fabric 依赖项</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Curios</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gFyQBPW.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><strong>Trinkets</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FVV3gSp/elytratrinket.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>下载</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot-fabric/files/all\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric 1.16.1 - 1.19.2</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric 1.19.3+</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:9153\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Quilt</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>支持</h2>\n<p>请将所有漏洞、问题及功能请求提交至\n<a href=\"https://github.com/illusivesoulworks/elytraslot/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪器</a>。</p>\n<p>如需非技术支持或提问，请加入开发者的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JWgrdwt\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>。</p>\n<h2>许可证</h2>\n<p>所有源代码及资源均遵循 LGPL-3.0-or-later 协议授权。</p>\n<h2>捐赠</h2>\n<p>开发者可通过 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fC0C1NL4O\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a> 接受捐赠。</p>\n<h2>合作伙伴</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fillusive\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/1G4QPdc/bh-illusive.png\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p>",
